Do you stil have your pet? This is one of the many occasions where you
could really use it.

Pets won't step on cursed items.

So drop all armour and rings you've found so far, on different squares in
a room, and pick up all items that your pet steps on. These are NOT
cursed, unless you get the message "<foo> moves only reluctantly". You can
safely try on those items (with the exception of some headgear that will
auto-curse when you try it on.

You also will weed out cursed potions, scrolls and spellbooks (and other
cursed types of objects) this way, which will make random trying somewhat
less dangerous. I still wouldn't do it, though.

